{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0169657nhbC6pngqiBuC8ZYd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n5\t- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n6\t- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n10\t2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is governed by trace diversity (C0), which reflects effective output diversity — SICA adds value when C0>20% (diverse outputs, disagreement to resolve) but degenerates to SC when C0<5% (converged outputs, no disagreement). C0 empirically correlates with task-relative model confidence: instruction models show high C0 on challenging tasks, reasoning models show low C0 universally. Validated across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA) and 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1). [Note: \"C0 → epistemic uncertainty\" connection reserved for Discussion, not formal claim — reviewer risk of terminology abuse per UQ community standards.]\n11\t3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n12\t\n13\t## Core Insight\n14\tSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that trace diversity (C0) — reflecting task-relative model confidence rather than model family or task domain alone — determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries,\" validated across 3 model families and multiple reasoning domains.\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n18\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n19\t- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75%+ win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) — a zero-cost diagnostic reflecting effective output diversity — and validate across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA), 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1), and multiple domains (logic, math).\n20\t- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n21\t\n22\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n23\t1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 804 questions for statistical power\n24\t2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity; exp-009: overhead analysis (P1); exp-013: constraint ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight)\n25\t3. **\"Only Qwen models — family-specific artifact?\"** → exp-010: Mistral-7B + exp-011: LLaMA-8B (3-family validation)\n26\t4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → exp-014: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (second reasoning architecture)\n27\t5. **\"Only logic domain — restricted answer space\"** → exp-012: GSM8K pilot with 14B (cross-domain C0 test)\n28\t6. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n29\t7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison (done on D012, will re-run on expanded)\n30\t8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B + exp-014: DeepSeek-R1 show reasoning models are self-consistent → SICA redundant; instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit\n31\t9. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: Constraint ablation proves satisfiability checking adds value over simple counting\n32\t10. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004: 7B + exp-007: 72B-AWQ show C0 trend within Qwen family\n33\t\n34\t## Working Title\n35\t**\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? Characterizing the Operating Regime of Constraint-Based Reasoning Aggregation\"**\n36\t(Alternatives: \"Beyond Majority Voting: Using Trace Diversity to Predict When Symbolic Consensus Improves LLM Reasoning\")\n37\t\n38\t## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n39\t- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results 7 models × datasets), T2 (Tiebreak Comparison), T3 (K Sensitivity), T4 (Overhead)\n40\t- Main Figures: F1 (Pipeline), F2 (C0 vs Gap Scatter — hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap), F4 (K Curve)\n41\t- Appendix: Constraint Ablation (exp-013), Case Studies (exp-008), GSM8K (exp-012), Per-Problem Detail\n42\t\n43\t## Claim Risk Notes\n44\t- **Claim 1 make-or-break**: exp-013 constraint ablation. If MaxSAT ≈ count-only → reframe as \"principled weighting\" not \"satisfiability-based reasoning\"\n45\t- **Claim 3 downgrade risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\" not \"continuous predictor\". Gradient depends on 7B C0 >> 14B C0 >> 72B C0.\n46\t- **\"Epistemic uncertainty\" terminology**: Reserve for Discussion section only. Main text uses \"effective output diversity\" / \"task-relative model confidence\". UQ community would attack formal misuse.\n47\t\n48\t## Contingency Plan (D023)\n49\t**Trigger**: exp-001 完整结果 SICA ≤ SC（gap ≤ 0pp 或不显著）\n50\t**Strategy**: Option A (Analysis Paper) + Option C (FOLIO sub-claim if positive)\n51\t- 论文主线从\"SICA improves accuracy\"转为\"characterizing operating conditions of symbolic consensus\"\n52\t- C0 threshold pattern 成为核心贡献（\"at what C0 level does SICA begin to match/exceed SC?\")\n53\t- FOLIO 正向结果嵌入为\"domain formality → effectiveness\"子 claim\n54\t- Claim 1 弱化为\"principled + interpretable tiebreaking\"（不 claim accuracy gain）\n55\t- 需补：constraint extraction quality vs delta 相关性分析（CPU-only）\n56\t- Venue: EMNLP Main (30-35%) / Findings (60-70%) / AAAI 2027 fallback\n57\t**Decision point**: exp-001 FOLIO 70题的 C0 和 delta\n58\t\n59\t## Venue Fit Risks\n60\t- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n61\t- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n62\t- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n63\t- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n64\t- **[D023 新增]** If SICA ≤ SC globally: pivot to analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02c0753b-3714-4e7c-8945-6ff304731670","uuid":"bde54fb9-d971-41b1-8b57-00db754ee644","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:03:40.406Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T124139/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n- Fallback: AAAI 2027 (Aug 1)\n- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n1. **Principled Tiebreaking**: SICA resolves Self-Consistency voting ties through symbolic constraint weighting, achieving higher accuracy than arbitrary tiebreak rules on logic reasoning benchmarks (FOLIO +6.7pp, combined +3.3pp on 60 questions; target: statistically significant on 200+ questions).\n2. **Operating Regime Characterization**: The effectiveness of symbolic consensus is governed by trace diversity (C0), which reflects effective output diversity — SICA adds value when C0>20% (diverse outputs, disagreement to resolve) but degenerates to SC when C0<5% (converged outputs, no disagreement). C0 empirically correlates with task-relative model confidence: instruction models show high C0 on challenging tasks, reasoning models show low C0 universally. Validated across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA) and 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1). [Note: \"C0 → epistemic uncertainty\" connection reserved for Discussion, not formal claim — reviewer risk of terminology abuse per UQ community standards.]\n3. **C0 as Practical Diagnostic**: Multi-candidate rate (C0) serves as a zero-cost predictor of whether SICA deployment will yield gains over SC, enabling practitioners to decide without running full symbolic analysis.\n\n## Core Insight\nSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't uniformly improve reasoning — it specifically helps when there IS disagreement to resolve. We provide the first systematic study of WHEN symbolic consensus adds value, revealing that trace diversity (C0) — reflecting task-relative model confidence rather than model family or task domain alone — determines the operating regime. This transforms SICA from \"yet another ensemble method\" into \"a method with formally characterizable applicability boundaries,\" validated across 3 model families and multiple reasoning domains.\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Self-Consistency (SC) aggregates LLM reasoning paths via majority voting but treats all chains as opaque votes, discarding the logical structure within them. When votes are tied, SC falls back to arbitrary rules (alphabetical, random) with no principled resolution.\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023) — pure voting, no reasoning structure. USC (Chen et al. 2023) — universal SC, still voting-based. None exploit the formal logical structure within reasoning traces for consensus, and none characterize when symbolic methods help vs. don't.\n- **Our framing**: SICA extracts first-order logic constraints from reasoning traces and uses weighted partial MAX-SAT to find the globally consistent answer. We show this provides principled tiebreaking (75%+ win rate on ties vs 25% for SC) but only when trace diversity exists. We formalize this as C0 (multi-candidate rate) — a zero-cost diagnostic reflecting effective output diversity — and validate across 3 model families (Qwen, Mistral, LLaMA), 2 reasoning architectures (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1), and multiple domains (logic, math).\n- **Headline result template**: \"On FOLIO, SICA achieves 80.0% vs SC's 73.3% (+6.7pp) with Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct. On the same benchmarks with QwQ-32B, SICA degenerates to SC (C0=3.6%), revealing that symbolic consensus effectiveness is governed by trace diversity, not task difficulty.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → exp-001: Expand to 804 questions for statistical power\n2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K sensitivity; exp-009: overhead analysis (P1); exp-013: constraint ablation (MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight)\n3. **\"Only Qwen models — family-specific artifact?\"** → exp-010: Mistral-7B + exp-011: LLaMA-8B (3-family validation)\n4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → exp-014: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (second reasoning architecture)\n5. **\"Only logic domain — restricted answer space\"** → exp-012: GSM8K pilot with 14B (cross-domain C0 test)\n6. **\"ProofWriter shows 0pp gain\"** → Domain analysis in exp-001 expanded results\n7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline closes the gap\"** → exp-003: Direct SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic comparison (done on D012, will re-run on expanded)\n8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → exp-005: QwQ-32B + exp-014: DeepSeek-R1 show reasoning models are self-consistent → SICA redundant; instruction models (cheaper, more deployed) benefit\n9. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: Constraint ablation proves satisfiability checking adds value over simple counting\n10. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004: 7B + exp-007: 72B-AWQ show C0 trend within Qwen family\n\n## Working Title\n**\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? Characterizing the Operating Regime of Constraint-Based Reasoning Aggregation\"**\n(Alternatives: \"Beyond Majority Voting: Using Trace Diversity to Predict When Symbolic Consensus Improves LLM Reasoning\")\n\n## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results 7 models × datasets), T2 (Tiebreak Comparison), T3 (K Sensitivity), T4 (Overhead)\n- Main Figures: F1 (Pipeline), F2 (C0 vs Gap Scatter — hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap), F4 (K Curve)\n- Appendix: Constraint Ablation (exp-013), Case Studies (exp-008), GSM8K (exp-012), Per-Problem Detail\n\n## Claim Risk Notes\n- **Claim 1 make-or-break**: exp-013 constraint ablation. If MaxSAT ≈ count-only → reframe as \"principled weighting\" not \"satisfiability-based reasoning\"\n- **Claim 3 downgrade risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\" not \"continuous predictor\". Gradient depends on 7B C0 >> 14B C0 >> 72B C0.\n- **\"Epistemic uncertainty\" terminology**: Reserve for Discussion section only. Main text uses \"effective output diversity\" / \"task-relative model confidence\". UQ community would attack formal misuse.\n\n## Contingency Plan (D023)\n**Trigger**: exp-001 完整结果 SICA ≤ SC（gap ≤ 0pp 或不显著）\n**Strategy**: Option A (Analysis Paper) + Option C (FOLIO sub-claim if positive)\n- 论文主线从\"SICA improves accuracy\"转为\"characterizing operating conditions of symbolic consensus\"\n- C0 threshold pattern 成为核心贡献（\"at what C0 level does SICA begin to match/exceed SC?\")\n- FOLIO 正向结果嵌入为\"domain formality → effectiveness\"子 claim\n- Claim 1 弱化为\"principled + interpretable tiebreaking\"（不 claim accuracy gain）\n- 需补：constraint extraction quality vs delta 相关性分析（CPU-only）\n- Venue: EMNLP Main (30-35%) / Findings (60-70%) / AAAI 2027 fallback\n**Decision point**: exp-001 FOLIO 70题的 C0 和 delta\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- EMNLP: Contribution may feel narrow if framed as ONLY tiebreaking. Primary intellectual contribution is the \"operating regime characterization\" — the tiebreaking mechanism is evidence, not the claim.\n- Cross-discipline: Combines formal logic (MAX-SAT) with NLP (LLM reasoning). MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n- Negative results: QwQ-32B data must be presented as insight (\"When Does Symbolic Consensus Degenerate?\"), not failure.\n- Statistical power: 60-question results are fragile. 200+ question expansion is prerequisite for credible submission.\n- **[D023 新增]** If SICA ≤ SC globally: pivot to analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic.\n","numLines":65,"startLine":1,"totalLines":65}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LEe1pe1PWjx7xN7KgBGUVi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"n_total\": 804,\n7\t      \"n_folio\": 204,\n8\t      \"n_pw\": 600,\n9\t      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.723,\n10\t      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.72,\n11\t      \"combined_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n12\t      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.42,\n13\t      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.755,\n14\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.74,\n15\t      \"folio_gap_pp\": 1.5,\n16\t      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.28,\n17\t      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.712,\n18\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.713,\n19\t      \"pw_gap_pp\": -0.1,\n20\t      \"bootstrap_p_pw\": 0.55,\n21\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.38,\n22\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.42,\n23\t      \"c0_combined\": 0.41,\n24\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n25\t      \"tiebreak_count_folio\": 18,\n26\t      \"tiebreak_count_pw\": 55,\n27\t      \"tiebreak_sica_win_rate\": 0.55,\n28\t      \"wall_time_h\": 13.5\n29\t    },\n30\t    \"tables\": [\n31\t      {\n32\t        \"name\": \"T1_main_results_expanded\",\n33\t        \"content\": \"| Dataset    |   N | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap (pp) | p-value |  C0  |\\n|------------|-----|--------|----------|----------|---------|------|\\n| FOLIO      | 204 | 74.0%  |  75.5%   |   +1.5   |  0.28   | 0.38 |\\n| PW-D5      | 600 | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |   -0.1   |  0.55   | 0.42 |\\n| Combined   | 804 | 72.0%  |  72.3%   |   +0.3   |  0.42   | 0.41 |\\n| D012 (ref) |  60 | 70.0%  |  73.3%   |   +3.3   |  0.23   | 0.53 |\\n\"\n34\t      }\n35\t    ],\n36\t    \"figures\": [],\n37\t    \"analysis\": \"D023 trigger确认。FOLIO gap ≤+2pp且p>0.20，combined gap ≈0。论文必须pivot。 但C0=0.38-0.42的数据仍然有价值——证明14B instruction model在这些任务上确实产生 trace diversity，只是symbolic aggregation无法有效利用这些diversity。\\n\\n\\nD012的60题FOLIO +6.7pp是小样本方差膨胀的产物。扩展到204题后，FOLIO的gain从+6.7pp 回归到+1.5pp（p=0.28），因为D012中SICA赢的那几道tiebreak题恰好是高信息量的，但在 更大样本中tiebreak题的比例被稀释、且新增题中constraint extraction质量参差不齐—— 约30%的FOLIO新增题涉及复杂嵌套量词，extraction产生shallow/错误constraints，MaxSAT 解与count-only等价。PW在600题规模上SICA与SC几乎完全一致（-0.1pp），因为PW的逻辑 结构虽然更formal，但14B在PW D5上的SC已经接近ceiling（~71%），剩余错题多为模型 根本理解不了的推理链，constraint extraction无法挽救。Combined gap仅+0.3pp， bootstrap p=0.42，远未达到显著性。核心问题：constraint extraction的噪声在大样本 中不再被幸运tiebreak掩盖。\\n\"\n38\t  },\n39\t  {\n40\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n41\t    \"description\": \"K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions\",\n42\t    \"results\": {\n43\t      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n44\t      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n45\t      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n46\t      \"k6_c0\": 0.45,\n47\t      \"k6_tiebreak_count\": 8,\n48\t      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n49\t      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n50\t      \"k8_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n51\t      \"k8_c0\": 0.48,\n52\t      \"k8_tiebreak_count\": 6,\n53\t      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n54\t      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n55\t      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n56\t      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n57\t      \"k12_tiebreak_count\": 5,\n58\t      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n59\t      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n60\t      \"k16_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n61\t      \"k16_c0\": 0.52,\n62\t      \"k16_tiebreak_count\": 3,\n63\t      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n64\t      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n65\t      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n66\t      \"k20_c0\": 0.5,\n67\t      \"k20_tiebreak_count\": 2,\n68\t      \"wall_time_h\": 4.8\n69\t    },\n70\t    \"tables\": [\n71\t      {\n72\t        \"name\": \"T3_k_sensitivity\",\n73\t        \"content\": \"|  K  | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   | #Ties | Tie Win% |\\n|-----|--------|----------|-----|------|-------|----------|\\n|  6  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.45 |   8   |  56.3%   |\\n|  8  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.48 |   6   |  55.0%   |\\n| 12  | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.53 |   5   |  60.0%   |\\n| 16  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.52 |   3   |  50.0%   |\\n| 20  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.50 |   2   |  50.0%   |\\n\"\n74\t      }\n75\t    ],\n76\t    \"figures\": [],\n77\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier下K ablation暴露SICA的核心弱点：gain完全是tiebreak artifact。 对analysis paper有价值：说明constraint-based方法在非tie场景无法改变SC的选择， 因为extraction noise使constraint分布与answer正确性无相关性。\\n\\n\\nK=12时的+3.3pp是D012原始结果的复现，但这个gain几乎完全来自tiebreak场景。 K=6/8（奇数tiebreak不可能或更少）时gap降到+1.7pp，因为偶数K下tie更频繁但 SICA在tie上的win rate仅~55%，所以净gain不稳定。K=16/20时tie几乎消失（majority 更decisive），gap归零。这揭示了一个致命模式：SICA的gain完全依赖于tiebreak频率， 而非对非tie题的改进。K增大→tie减少→gain消失，说明SICA不是在做更好的推理聚合， 只是在coin-flip场景中略好于random。C0随K略有变化但基本稳定在0.45-0.53，说明 trace diversity是模型固有属性而非K的函数——这一点对analysis paper有价值。\\n\"\n78\t  },\n79\t  {\n80\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n81\t    \"description\": \"SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic tiebreak comparison, CPU reanalysis\",\n82\t    \"results\": {\n83\t      \"n_tiebreak_problems_d012\": 5,\n84\t      \"sica_tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.6,\n85\t      \"sc_random_tiebreak_expected_win_rate\": 0.5,\n86\t      \"sc_alphabetical_win_rate\": 0.6,\n87\t      \"sc_first_seen_win_rate\": 0.4,\n88\t      \"n_tiebreak_problems_expanded\": 73,\n89\t      \"sica_tiebreak_win_rate_expanded\": 0.534,\n90\t      \"sc_random_expected_expanded\": 0.5,\n91\t      \"bootstrap_p_sica_vs_random_expanded\": 0.31,\n92\t      \"sica_minus_random_gap_on_ties_pp\": 3.4,\n93\t      \"overall_sica_vs_sc_random_gap_pp\": 0.1\n94\t    },\n95\t    \"tables\": [\n96\t      {\n97\t        \"name\": \"T2_tiebreak_comparison\",\n98\t        \"content\": \"| Tiebreak Method    | D012 (5 ties) | Expanded (73 ties) | p vs random |\\n|--------------------|---------------|--------------------|-------------|\\n| SICA (MaxSAT)      |   80.0%       |     53.4%          |    0.31     |\\n| SC-random          |   50.0%       |     50.0% (E)      |     —       |\\n| SC-alphabetical    |   60.0%       |     49.3%          |    0.48     |\\n| SC-first-seen      |   40.0%       |     50.7%          |    0.47     |\\n\"\n99\t      }\n100\t    ],\n101\t    \"figures\": [],\n102\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier核心证据之一。SICA的tiebreak优势在大样本中消失，与random不可区分。 对analysis paper的contribution：证明constraint extraction的质量不足以在 真正ambiguous的题上提供信号——constraints是shallow syntactic patterns， 不capture deep reasoning validity。\\n\\n\\nD012上5个tiebreak题SICA赢4个（80%）是小样本幸运。扩展到exp-001的73个tiebreak题后， SICA的tiebreak win rate回归到53.4%——仅比random的50%高3.4pp，bootstrap p=0.31， 不显著。核心原因：constraint extraction在tiebreak题上的质量与非tiebreak题无差异， 而tiebreak题本身是模型\\\"真不确定\\\"的题，extracted constraints同样嘈杂、浅层， MaxSAT无法从噪声中提取信号。SICA略高于random可能只是因为MaxSAT倾向于选择 constraint数更多的answer，而这与正确性有微弱正相关（正确reasoning chain产生 略多parseable constraints）。但这个效应太弱，无法在统计上与random区分。\\n\"\n103\t  },\n104\t  {\n105\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n106\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\",\n107\t    \"results\": {\n108\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n109\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n110\t      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n111\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.38,\n112\t      \"c0\": 0.55,\n113\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.5,\n114\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.58,\n115\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n116\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.545,\n117\t      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.633,\n118\t      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.545,\n119\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.045,\n120\t      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.42,\n121\t      \"wall_time_h\": 1.8\n122\t    },\n123\t    \"tables\": [\n124\t      {\n125\t        \"name\": \"scaling_7b_row\",\n126\t        \"content\": \"| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\\n|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\\n| 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\\n| 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\\n\"\n127\t      }\n128\t    ],\n129\t    \"figures\": [],\n130\t    \"analysis\": \"C0高但gap不显著——直接反驳\\\"C0 predicts SICA gain\\\"的简单叙事。 对analysis paper：C0 predicts diversity (✓) 但不 predict gain (✗)， 因为constraint extraction quality是hidden confounder。\\n\\n\\n7B模型更弱→C0更高（0.55 vs 14B的0.53），符合\\\"weaker model = more diversity\\\"假设。 但SICA gain仅+1.7pp（p=0.38），不显著。原因：虽然7B产生更多diversity（更多tie和 multi-candidate问题），但7B的constraint extraction质量更差——7B生成的reasoning traces更短、逻辑结构更松散，LLM-based extraction从这些traces中提取的constraints 更浅层、更多噪声。高C0+低extraction quality=SICA无法利用diversity。这是worst tier 的核心失败模式：C0确实预测diversity，但diversity≠SICA can help，因为中间的 constraint extraction是bottleneck。FOLIO上有微弱+3.3pp是因为FOLIO答案空间 只有3类（True/False/Unknown），即使noisy constraints也能偶尔选对。\\n\"\n131\t  },\n132\t  {\n133\t    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n134\t    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\",\n135\t    \"results\": {\n136\t      \"c0_aime\": 0.0,\n137\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.188,\n138\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.0,\n139\t      \"c0_combined\": 0.036,\n140\t      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n141\t      \"n_total\": 48,\n142\t      \"finding\": \"Reasoning model structurally self-consistent across all domains and temperatures\",\n143\t      \"temperature_effect\": \"Zero diversity at T=0.7, 0.9, 1.0\"\n144\t    },\n145\t    \"tables\": [\n146\t      {\n147\t        \"name\": \"qwq_operating_regime\",\n148\t        \"content\": \"| Domain | N  | C0    | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap |\\n|--------|----|-------|--------|----------|-----|\\n| AIME   | 22 | 0.0%  | 72.7%  |  72.7%   | 0.0 |\\n| PW     | 16 | 18.8% | ~69%   |  ~69%    | 0.0 |\\n| FOLIO  | 10 | 0.0%  |  —     |   —      | 0.0 |\\n\"\n149\t      }\n150\t    ],\n151\t    \"figures\": [],\n152\t    \"analysis\": \"对analysis paper是正面贡献：reasoning model的self-consistency是一个有发表价值的 empirical finding。Frame为\\\"reasoning models represent a fundamentally different operating regime where symbolic consensus is structurally redundant\\\"。\\n\\n\\n这是已有数据的重新整理，不产生新结果。QwQ-32B的C0=3.6%已经确认reasoning model 的structural self-consistency。在worst tier下这个数据点的价值反而增强——它是 analysis paper的核心finding之一：reasoning models (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1) 的 extended thinking chain使输出高度确定性，温度采样无法打破这个determinism。 这不是SICA的失败，而是reasoning model internals的特性。\\n\"\n153\t  },\n154\t  {\n155\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n156\t    \"description\": \"C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models and K values, CPU analysis\",\n157\t    \"results\": {\n158\t      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n159\t      \"pearson_r_c0_vs_gap\": 0.31,\n160\t      \"pearson_p\": 0.33,\n161\t      \"spearman_rho\": 0.27,\n162\t      \"binary_threshold_accuracy\": 0.75,\n163\t      \"c0_threshold_used\": 0.2,\n164\t      \"high_c0_avg_gap\": 0.8,\n165\t      \"low_c0_avg_gap\": 0.0,\n166\t      \"high_c0_points\": 8,\n167\t      \"low_c0_points\": 4\n168\t    },\n169\t    \"tables\": [\n170\t      {\n171\t        \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_summary\",\n172\t        \"content\": \"| Model              | Type        | C0    | Gap(pp) |\\n|--------------------|-------------|-------|---------|\\n| Qwen2.5-7B        | instruction | 0.55  |  +1.7   |\\n| Qwen2.5-14B (D012)| instruction | 0.53  |  +3.3   |\\n| Qwen2.5-14B (exp) | instruction | 0.41  |  +0.3   |\\n| Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ   | instruction | 0.32  |  +0.5   |\\n| Mistral-7B         | instruction | 0.35  |  -0.5   |\\n| LLaMA-8B           | instruction | 0.30  |  +1.0   |\\n| QwQ-32B            | reasoning   | 0.04  |   0.0   |\\n| DeepSeek-R1-8B     | reasoning   | 0.05  |   0.0   |\\n\"\n173\t      }\n174\t    ],\n175\t    \"figures\": [],\n176\t    \"analysis\": \"C0作为continuous predictor失败，仅作为binary indicator区分reasoning/instruction。 对analysis paper：C0的价值从\\\"predict gain\\\"转为\\\"characterize model behavior\\\"—— 一个关于模型内部一致性的诊断工具，而非SICA部署决策工具。\\n\\n\\n在worst tier下，C0与gap的连续相关性很弱（r=0.31, p=0.33），因为高C0的数据点 （7B/14B/Mistral/LLaMA instruction models）虽然都有C0>20%，但gap分布在 [-1pp, +2pp]之间，无清晰趋势。二值分类（C0>20% → potential gain vs C0<20% → no gain）准确率75%，但这主要是因为low-C0点（QwQ, DeepSeek-R1）gap全为0， 而不是因为high-C0点gap都>0。实质上C0只能区分\\\"reasoning vs instruction\\\"， 不能在instruction model内部预测gain大小。这使得Claim 3从\\\"continuous predictor\\\" 弱化为\\\"binary family classifier\\\"——而这基本等于直接看模型是否是reasoning model， C0作为diagnostic的增量价值存疑。\\n\"\n177\t  },\n178\t  {\n179\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n180\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions\",\n181\t    \"results\": {\n182\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n183\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.783,\n184\t      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n185\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.5,\n186\t      \"c0\": 0.32,\n187\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.27,\n188\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.35,\n189\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.833,\n190\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.75,\n191\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.022,\n192\t      \"wall_time_h\": 3.8\n193\t    },\n194\t    \"tables\": [\n195\t      {\n196\t        \"name\": \"scaling_72b_row\",\n197\t        \"content\": \"| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\\n|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\\n| 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\\n| 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\\n| 72B   | 78.3%  |  78.3%   | 0.0 | 0.50 | 0.32 |\\n\"\n198\t      }\n199\t    ],\n200\t    \"figures\": [],\n201\t    \"analysis\": \"72B数据点完善了within-family scaling故事。对analysis paper：展示了一个 \\\"sweet spot\\\"幻觉——14B似乎是optimal，但扩展到大样本后14B的gap也消失。 真正的故事是constraint extraction quality不随model size scaling。\\n\\n\\n72B模型更强→SC accuracy更高（78.3% vs 14B的70%），C0降到0.32（更confident→ 更少diversity）。Gap=0pp因为：(1) 高accuracy意味着SC已经选对了大部分题， 剩余错题是72B根本做不对的hard题；(2) C0=0.32虽然>20%但tiebreak题更少（约3个）， 样本太小无法产生可见gap；(3) 72B的constraint extraction质量虽然比7B/14B好， 但在它做错的题上constraints同样misleading。这个数据点支持\\\"stronger model → less room for SICA\\\"的叙事，但也支持worst tier的核心论点：即使在C0>20%的 optimal operating range内，SICA也不能reliably beat SC。\\n\"\n202\t  },\n203\t  {\n204\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n205\t    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions' extracted constraints\",\n206\t    \"results\": {\n207\t      \"n_analyzed\": 8,\n208\t      \"semantically_meaningful_rate\": 0.45,\n209\t      \"shallow_pattern_rate\": 0.35,\n210\t      \"noise_rate\": 0.2,\n211\t      \"correct_exclusion_rate\": 0.3,\n212\t      \"false_exclusion_rate\": 0.15,\n213\t      \"missed_error_rate\": 0.55,\n214\t      \"finding\": \"Constraints are predominantly surface-level pattern matches, not deep logical validators\"\n215\t    },\n216\t    \"tables\": [],\n217\t    \"figures\": [],\n218\t    \"analysis\": \"这是analysis paper最有叙事价值的实验之一。定性证据直接支撑\\\"why doesn't it work\\\" 的故事：extraction bottleneck。LLM-based constraint extraction无法从free-form reasoning traces中提取足够faithful的逻辑约束。\\n\\n\\n定性分析揭示constraint extraction的根本问题：(1) ~45%的constraints语义上有意义 但过于浅层（如\\\"answer must be True or False\\\"）,不能区分正确/错误推理； (2) ~35%是shallow pattern matches（从推理trace中提取的句法模式而非逻辑约束）； (3) ~20%是纯噪声（extraction hallucination或parse error）。关键发现：在SICA 选错而SC选对的题上，constraints质量与选对的题无显著差异——说明MaxSAT不是在 \\\"选择better constrained answer\\\"，而是在\\\"基于noisy signal做coin flip\\\"。 正确排除（exclusion导致正确答案翻转）仅30%，意味着大部分exclusion是neutral或harmful。\\n\"\n219\t  },\n220\t  {\n221\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n222\t    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT\",\n223\t    \"results\": {\n224\t      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 45.2,\n225\t      \"avg_generation_time_s\": 38.5,\n226\t      \"avg_extraction_time_s\": 5.8,\n227\t      \"avg_maxsat_time_s\": 0.9,\n228\t      \"generation_fraction\": 0.852,\n229\t      \"extraction_fraction\": 0.128,\n230\t      \"maxsat_fraction\": 0.02,\n231\t      \"overhead_vs_sc_percent\": 17.4,\n232\t      \"finding\": \"SICA adds ~17% wall-time overhead over SC, dominated by extraction LLM calls\"\n233\t    },\n234\t    \"tables\": [\n235\t      {\n236\t        \"name\": \"T4_overhead\",\n237\t        \"content\": \"| Phase       | Time(s) | Fraction | Notes                    |\\n|-------------|---------|----------|--------------------------|\\n| Generation  |  38.5   |  85.2%   | Same as SC               |\\n| Extraction  |   5.8   |  12.8%   | 1 LLM call per trace     |\\n| MaxSAT      |   0.9   |   2.0%   | Z3, <100 constraints     |\\n| **Total**   |  45.2   | 100.0%   | +17.4% vs SC baseline    |\\n\"\n238\t      }\n239\t    ],\n240\t    \"figures\": [],\n241\t    \"analysis\": \"Overhead moderate但gain为零——cost-benefit明确为负。对analysis paper有价值： 排除\\\"overhead是barrier\\\"假说，聚焦在extraction quality而非computational cost。\\n\\n\\nGeneration（vLLM inference）占~85%时间，这与SC相同。SICA的额外overhead来自 constraint extraction（~13%，每个trace一次extraction LLM call）和MaxSAT solving （~2%，Z3在小规模constraint sets上极快）。总overhead ~17%在worst tier下意味着 \\\"付出17%时间代价换来0pp gain\\\"——对analysis paper来说这是一个重要的负面数据点。 但也说明overhead不是failure的原因（不是\\\"太贵所以不值\\\"而是\\\"even with acceptable cost it doesn't help\\\"）。Extraction时间可优化（batch inference）但不改变 fundamental result。\\n\"\n242\t  },\n243\t  {\n244\t    \"name\": \"sica_mistral_7b\",\n245\t    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, cross-family validation\",\n246\t    \"results\": {\n247\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.55,\n248\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n249\t      \"gap_pp\": -1.7,\n250\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.65,\n251\t      \"c0\": 0.35,\n252\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.3,\n253\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.38,\n254\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.633,\n255\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.523,\n256\t      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n257\t      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.523,\n258\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.052,\n259\t      \"constraint_parse_error_rate\": 0.12,\n260\t      \"wall_time_h\": 1.3\n261\t    },\n262\t    \"tables\": [\n263\t      {\n264\t        \"name\": \"mistral_row\",\n265\t        \"content\": \"| Model       | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap   | p    | C0   |\\n|-------------|--------|----------|-------|------|------|\\n| Mistral-7B  | 56.7%  |  55.0%   | -1.7  | 0.65 | 0.35 |\\n\"\n266\t      }\n267\t    ],\n268\t    \"figures\": [],\n269\t    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier关键证据：high C0 + negative gap。C0 pattern跨家族成立（instruction models都有high C0），但这不translate to SICA gains。Extraction quality是 family-specific的，没有universal effectiveness。对analysis paper：constraint extraction的family-specificity是一个重要failure mode。\\n\\n\\nMistral-7B是一个关键的cross-family数据点。C0=0.35（>20%，instruction model 特征确认跨家族成立），但gap为负（-1.7pp）。原因：Mistral的reasoning trace风格与 Qwen不同——更短、更conversational、逻辑结构更隐式。基于Qwen trace风格tuned的 constraint extraction prompt在Mistral traces上效果更差（parse error rate 12% vs Qwen的~3%），产生更多noisy constraints。MaxSAT在noisy constraints下做出 worse-than-random的selection（exclusion rate 5.2%但exclusion更多是false positive）。 FOLIO上SICA反而比SC低3.3pp：3道FOLIO题上SICA的constraint-based选择选错了。 这是worst tier的smoking gun：SICA不仅不帮忙，在extraction quality差的情况下 actively harmful。\\n\"\n270\t  },\n271\t  {\n272\t    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n273\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, third model family\",\n274\t    \"results\": {\n275\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.533,\n276\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.517,\n277\t      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n278\t      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.4,\n279\t      \"c0\": 0.3,\n280\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.27,\n281\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.32,\n282\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.567,\n283\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.485,\n284\t      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n285\t      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.485,\n286\t      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.038,\n287\t      \"wall_time_h\": 1.2\n288\t    },\n289\t    \"tables\": [\n290\t      {\n291\t        \"name\": \"llama_row\",\n292\t        \"content\": \"| Model      | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap  | p    | C0   |\\n|------------|--------|----------|------|------|------|\\n| LLaMA-8B   | 51.7%  |  53.3%   | +1.7 | 0.40 | 0.30 |\\n\"\n293\t      }\n294\t    ],\n295\t    \"figures\": [],\n296\t    \"analysis\": \"三家族validation完成：C0 pattern holds (all instruction models C0>20%)， 但SICA gain inconsistent across families (Qwen略正, Mistral负, LLaMA略正)。 对analysis paper：C0 as diversity indicator validated; SICA as accuracy method invalidated。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B的SC accuracy最低（51.7%），C0=0.30（instruction model，high diversity confirmed）。Gap=+1.7pp（p=0.40），方向正确但不显著。LLaMA的reasoning traces比 Mistral更structured（更接近Qwen风格），extraction quality中等，所以gap没有变负。 但在这么低的accuracy base上+1.7pp可能只是noise（1题的差异）。C0=0.30低于7B Qwen 的0.55，可能因为LLaMA-8B在PW/FOLIO上部分题直接输出random答案而非structured reasoning，这些\\\"collapsed\\\"traces有相同的non-answer，被误计为low diversity。 三家族一起看：Qwen +1.7, Mistral -1.7, LLaMA +1.7，平均gap≈+0.6pp——实质为零。\\n\"\n297\t  },\n298\t  {\n299\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n300\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, cross-domain C0 test\",\n301\t    \"results\": {\n302\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.9,\n303\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9,\n304\t      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n305\t      \"c0\": 0.1,\n306\t      \"n_multi_candidate\": 3,\n307\t      \"sc_baseline_high\": true,\n308\t      \"constraint_extraction_issues\": \"Numeric answer space makes constraint extraction trivial but useless\",\n309\t      \"wall_time_h\": 0.8\n310\t    },\n311\t    \"tables\": [\n312\t      {\n313\t        \"name\": \"gsm8k_row\",\n314\t        \"content\": \"| Dataset | Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   |\\n|---------|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|\\n| GSM8K   | 14B   | 90.0%  |  90.0%   | 0.0 | 0.10 |\\n| FOLIO   | 14B   | 74.0%  |  75.5%   | 1.5 | 0.38 |\\n| PW-D5   | 14B   | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |-0.1 | 0.42 |\\n\"\n315\t      }\n316\t    ],\n317\t    \"figures\": [],\n318\t    \"analysis\": \"C0 as task-relative confidence indicator validated。14B在easy tasks上low C0， hard tasks上high C0。但这不help SICA's accuracy case。对analysis paper： 丰富了C0的characterization story。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K对14B来说太简单（SC=90%），C0=10%远低于FOLIO/PW的38-42%。14B在GSM8K上 高度self-consistent因为这些是grade school math——模型confident且通常正确。 C0=10%中的3道multi-candidate题是calculation errors（不同traces算出不同数字）， constraint extraction对numeric answers基本无意义（constraints变成\\\"answer=72\\\" vs \\\"answer=84\\\"这种trivial形式，MaxSAT退化为counting）。Gap=0pp。 这个结果对analysis paper有双面价值：(1) 证明C0反映task-relative model confidence （14B在easy math上confident→low C0, 在logic reasoning上uncertain→high C0）； (2) 证明SICA在open-answer domain无additional failure mode，只是没value。\\n\"\n319\t  },\n320\t  {\n321\t    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n322\t    \"description\": \"SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight, CPU ablation\",\n323\t    \"results\": {\n324\t      \"n_problems\": 804,\n325\t      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.723,\n326\t      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.722,\n327\t      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.718,\n328\t      \"maxsat_vs_countonly_gap_pp\": 0.1,\n329\t      \"maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp\": 0.5,\n330\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.72,\n331\t      \"bootstrap_p_maxsat_vs_countonly\": 0.48,\n332\t      \"tiebreak_agreement_maxsat_countonly\": 0.89,\n333\t      \"finding\": \"MaxSAT satisfiability checking adds no value over simple constraint counting\"\n334\t    },\n335\t    \"tables\": [\n336\t      {\n337\t        \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n338\t        \"content\": \"| Method        | Accuracy | vs SC  | vs MaxSAT | p vs MaxSAT |\\n|---------------|----------|--------|-----------|-------------|\\n| SICA-MaxSAT   | 72.3%    | +0.3pp |    —      |      —      |\\n| SICA-CountOnly| 72.2%    | +0.2pp |  -0.1pp   |    0.48     |\\n| SICA-RandWt   | 71.8%    | -0.2pp |  -0.5pp   |    0.35     |\\n| SC baseline   | 72.0%    |   —    |  -0.3pp   |    0.42     |\\n\"\n339\t      }\n340\t    ],\n341\t    \"figures\": [],\n342\t    \"analysis\": \"MaxSAT is over-engineering confirmed。但在analysis paper中这是一个有价值的 negative finding：formal satisfiability checking对LLM-extracted constraints 无附加价值，因为constraints缺乏inter-dependencies。Reframe为\\\"when does formal reasoning over constraints add value? When constraints have structure.\\\"\\n\\n\\n这是Claim 1的make-or-break实验。在worst tier下MaxSAT≈count-only（gap仅0.1pp, p=0.48）。原因：MaxSAT的附加价值来自satisfiability checking——检测constraints 之间的逻辑一致性，排除internally contradictory constraint sets。但实际extracted constraints几乎都是独立的（无cross-constraint logical dependencies），因为 extraction prompt从each trace independently提取，不产生inter-constraint implications。结果Z3的satisfiability solver对所有constraint sets都返回SAT （没有unsatisfiable subsets to detect），MaxSAT退化为weighted counting。 Tiebreak上MaxSAT和count-only的选择89%一致。Random-weight略差但差距也很小 （0.5pp），说明constraint count本身与正确性的相关性非常微弱。\\n\"\n343\t  },\n344\t  {\n345\t    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n346\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on 60 questions, second reasoning model\",\n347\t    \"results\": {\n348\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.633,\n349\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.633,\n350\t      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n351\t      \"c0\": 0.05,\n352\t      \"c0_folio\": 0.03,\n353\t      \"c0_pw\": 0.06,\n354\t      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.7,\n355\t      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.59,\n356\t      \"temperature_invariance\": true,\n357\t      \"wall_time_h\": 1.8\n358\t    },\n359\t    \"tables\": [\n360\t      {\n361\t        \"name\": \"reasoning_models_combined\",\n362\t        \"content\": \"| Model              | Base   | Type      | C0   | Gap  |\\n|--------------------|--------|-----------|------|------|\\n| QwQ-32B            | Qwen   | reasoning | 3.6% | 0.0  |\\n| DeepSeek-R1-8B     | LLaMA  | reasoning | 5.0% | 0.0  |\\n| LLaMA-3.1-8B-Inst | LLaMA  | instruct  | 30%  | +1.7 |\\n\"\n363\t      }\n364\t    ],\n365\t    \"figures\": [],\n366\t    \"analysis\": \"对analysis paper的核心贡献之一：reasoning training fundamentally changes output diversity characteristics。Same LLaMA-8B base, instruction版C0=30%, reasoning版C0=5%。这是关于reasoning model internals的novel finding： reasoning training doesn't just improve accuracy, it collapses the output distribution. Frame为understanding WHY reasoning models are self-consistent.\\n\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B是第二个reasoning model数据点。C0=5%（与QwQ-32B的 3.6%相近），SICA≡SC。虽然这是8B的distilled版本（base是LLaMA而非Qwen），其 reasoning training使其表现出与QwQ-32B相同的self-consistency特征：extended thinking chain deterministically converges to single answer regardless of temperature sampling。C0=5%中的微量diversity来自PW（6%），可能是因为distillation 在logic domain上不如QwQ-32B彻底，少数题的reasoning chain有细微分歧。 关键确认：self-consistency是reasoning training的产物而非architecture/family 的产物（LLaMA base instruction model C0=30%, 同LLaMA base reasoning model C0=5%）。\\n\"\n367\t  }\n368\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02c0753b-3714-4e7c-8945-6ff304731670","uuid":"4f061021-7d7a-476a-bc68-d6f47d2d6fd5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:03:40.463Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T124139/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_expanded_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_total\": 804,\n      \"n_folio\": 204,\n      \"n_pw\": 600,\n      \"sica_accuracy_combined\": 0.723,\n      \"sc_accuracy_combined\": 0.72,\n      \"combined_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"bootstrap_p_combined\": 0.42,\n      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.755,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.74,\n      \"folio_gap_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"bootstrap_p_folio\": 0.28,\n      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.712,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.713,\n      \"pw_gap_pp\": -0.1,\n      \"bootstrap_p_pw\": 0.55,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.38,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.42,\n      \"c0_combined\": 0.41,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.031,\n      \"tiebreak_count_folio\": 18,\n      \"tiebreak_count_pw\": 55,\n      \"tiebreak_sica_win_rate\": 0.55,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 13.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T1_main_results_expanded\",\n        \"content\": \"| Dataset    |   N | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap (pp) | p-value |  C0  |\\n|------------|-----|--------|----------|----------|---------|------|\\n| FOLIO      | 204 | 74.0%  |  75.5%   |   +1.5   |  0.28   | 0.38 |\\n| PW-D5      | 600 | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |   -0.1   |  0.55   | 0.42 |\\n| Combined   | 804 | 72.0%  |  72.3%   |   +0.3   |  0.42   | 0.41 |\\n| D012 (ref) |  60 | 70.0%  |  73.3%   |   +3.3   |  0.23   | 0.53 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"D023 trigger确认。FOLIO gap ≤+2pp且p>0.20，combined gap ≈0。论文必须pivot。 但C0=0.38-0.42的数据仍然有价值——证明14B instruction model在这些任务上确实产生 trace diversity，只是symbolic aggregation无法有效利用这些diversity。\\n\\n\\nD012的60题FOLIO +6.7pp是小样本方差膨胀的产物。扩展到204题后，FOLIO的gain从+6.7pp 回归到+1.5pp（p=0.28），因为D012中SICA赢的那几道tiebreak题恰好是高信息量的，但在 更大样本中tiebreak题的比例被稀释、且新增题中constraint extraction质量参差不齐—— 约30%的FOLIO新增题涉及复杂嵌套量词，extraction产生shallow/错误constraints，MaxSAT 解与count-only等价。PW在600题规模上SICA与SC几乎完全一致（-0.1pp），因为PW的逻辑 结构虽然更formal，但14B在PW D5上的SC已经接近ceiling（~71%），剩余错题多为模型 根本理解不了的推理链，constraint extraction无法挽救。Combined gap仅+0.3pp， bootstrap p=0.42，远未达到显著性。核心问题：constraint extraction的噪声在大样本 中不再被幸运tiebreak掩盖。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k6_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k6_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k6_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k6_c0\": 0.45,\n      \"k6_tiebreak_count\": 8,\n      \"k8_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k8_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k8_gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"k8_c0\": 0.48,\n      \"k8_tiebreak_count\": 6,\n      \"k12_sica_acc\": 0.733,\n      \"k12_sc_acc\": 0.7,\n      \"k12_gap_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"k12_c0\": 0.53,\n      \"k12_tiebreak_count\": 5,\n      \"k16_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k16_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k16_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"k16_c0\": 0.52,\n      \"k16_tiebreak_count\": 3,\n      \"k20_sica_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k20_sc_acc\": 0.717,\n      \"k20_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"k20_c0\": 0.5,\n      \"k20_tiebreak_count\": 2,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 4.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T3_k_sensitivity\",\n        \"content\": \"|  K  | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   | #Ties | Tie Win% |\\n|-----|--------|----------|-----|------|-------|----------|\\n|  6  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.45 |   8   |  56.3%   |\\n|  8  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.48 |   6   |  55.0%   |\\n| 12  | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.53 |   5   |  60.0%   |\\n| 16  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.52 |   3   |  50.0%   |\\n| 20  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.50 |   2   |  50.0%   |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier下K ablation暴露SICA的核心弱点：gain完全是tiebreak artifact。 对analysis paper有价值：说明constraint-based方法在非tie场景无法改变SC的选择， 因为extraction noise使constraint分布与answer正确性无相关性。\\n\\n\\nK=12时的+3.3pp是D012原始结果的复现，但这个gain几乎完全来自tiebreak场景。 K=6/8（奇数tiebreak不可能或更少）时gap降到+1.7pp，因为偶数K下tie更频繁但 SICA在tie上的win rate仅~55%，所以净gain不稳定。K=16/20时tie几乎消失（majority 更decisive），gap归零。这揭示了一个致命模式：SICA的gain完全依赖于tiebreak频率， 而非对非tie题的改进。K增大→tie减少→gain消失，说明SICA不是在做更好的推理聚合， 只是在coin-flip场景中略好于random。C0随K略有变化但基本稳定在0.45-0.53，说明 trace diversity是模型固有属性而非K的函数——这一点对analysis paper有价值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic tiebreak comparison, CPU reanalysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_tiebreak_problems_d012\": 5,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_win_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"sc_random_tiebreak_expected_win_rate\": 0.5,\n      \"sc_alphabetical_win_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"sc_first_seen_win_rate\": 0.4,\n      \"n_tiebreak_problems_expanded\": 73,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_win_rate_expanded\": 0.534,\n      \"sc_random_expected_expanded\": 0.5,\n      \"bootstrap_p_sica_vs_random_expanded\": 0.31,\n      \"sica_minus_random_gap_on_ties_pp\": 3.4,\n      \"overall_sica_vs_sc_random_gap_pp\": 0.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T2_tiebreak_comparison\",\n        \"content\": \"| Tiebreak Method    | D012 (5 ties) | Expanded (73 ties) | p vs random |\\n|--------------------|---------------|--------------------|-------------|\\n| SICA (MaxSAT)      |   80.0%       |     53.4%          |    0.31     |\\n| SC-random          |   50.0%       |     50.0% (E)      |     —       |\\n| SC-alphabetical    |   60.0%       |     49.3%          |    0.48     |\\n| SC-first-seen      |   40.0%       |     50.7%          |    0.47     |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier核心证据之一。SICA的tiebreak优势在大样本中消失，与random不可区分。 对analysis paper的contribution：证明constraint extraction的质量不足以在 真正ambiguous的题上提供信号——constraints是shallow syntactic patterns， 不capture deep reasoning validity。\\n\\n\\nD012上5个tiebreak题SICA赢4个（80%）是小样本幸运。扩展到exp-001的73个tiebreak题后， SICA的tiebreak win rate回归到53.4%——仅比random的50%高3.4pp，bootstrap p=0.31， 不显著。核心原因：constraint extraction在tiebreak题上的质量与非tiebreak题无差异， 而tiebreak题本身是模型\\\"真不确定\\\"的题，extracted constraints同样嘈杂、浅层， MaxSAT无法从噪声中提取信号。SICA略高于random可能只是因为MaxSAT倾向于选择 constraint数更多的answer，而这与正确性有微弱正相关（正确reasoning chain产生 略多parseable constraints）。但这个效应太弱，无法在统计上与random区分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.38,\n      \"c0\": 0.55,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.5,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.58,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.545,\n      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.633,\n      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.545,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.045,\n      \"constraint_quality_score\": 0.42,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 1.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"scaling_7b_row\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\\n|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\\n| 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\\n| 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0高但gap不显著——直接反驳\\\"C0 predicts SICA gain\\\"的简单叙事。 对analysis paper：C0 predicts diversity (✓) 但不 predict gain (✗)， 因为constraint extraction quality是hidden confounder。\\n\\n\\n7B模型更弱→C0更高（0.55 vs 14B的0.53），符合\\\"weaker model = more diversity\\\"假设。 但SICA gain仅+1.7pp（p=0.38），不显著。原因：虽然7B产生更多diversity（更多tie和 multi-candidate问题），但7B的constraint extraction质量更差——7B生成的reasoning traces更短、逻辑结构更松散，LLM-based extraction从这些traces中提取的constraints 更浅层、更多噪声。高C0+低extraction quality=SICA无法利用diversity。这是worst tier 的核心失败模式：C0确实预测diversity，但diversity≠SICA can help，因为中间的 constraint extraction是bottleneck。FOLIO上有微弱+3.3pp是因为FOLIO答案空间 只有3类（True/False/Unknown），即使noisy constraints也能偶尔选对。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c0_aime\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.188,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.0,\n      \"c0_combined\": 0.036,\n      \"sica_sc_gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"n_total\": 48,\n      \"finding\": \"Reasoning model structurally self-consistent across all domains and temperatures\",\n      \"temperature_effect\": \"Zero diversity at T=0.7, 0.9, 1.0\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"qwq_operating_regime\",\n        \"content\": \"| Domain | N  | C0    | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap |\\n|--------|----|-------|--------|----------|-----|\\n| AIME   | 22 | 0.0%  | 72.7%  |  72.7%   | 0.0 |\\n| PW     | 16 | 18.8% | ~69%   |  ~69%    | 0.0 |\\n| FOLIO  | 10 | 0.0%  |  —     |   —      | 0.0 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"对analysis paper是正面贡献：reasoning model的self-consistency是一个有发表价值的 empirical finding。Frame为\\\"reasoning models represent a fundamentally different operating regime where symbolic consensus is structurally redundant\\\"。\\n\\n\\n这是已有数据的重新整理，不产生新结果。QwQ-32B的C0=3.6%已经确认reasoning model 的structural self-consistency。在worst tier下这个数据点的价值反而增强——它是 analysis paper的核心finding之一：reasoning models (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1) 的 extended thinking chain使输出高度确定性，温度采样无法打破这个determinism。 这不是SICA的失败，而是reasoning model internals的特性。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models and K values, CPU analysis\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n      \"pearson_r_c0_vs_gap\": 0.31,\n      \"pearson_p\": 0.33,\n      \"spearman_rho\": 0.27,\n      \"binary_threshold_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"c0_threshold_used\": 0.2,\n      \"high_c0_avg_gap\": 0.8,\n      \"low_c0_avg_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"high_c0_points\": 8,\n      \"low_c0_points\": 4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_summary\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model              | Type        | C0    | Gap(pp) |\\n|--------------------|-------------|-------|---------|\\n| Qwen2.5-7B        | instruction | 0.55  |  +1.7   |\\n| Qwen2.5-14B (D012)| instruction | 0.53  |  +3.3   |\\n| Qwen2.5-14B (exp) | instruction | 0.41  |  +0.3   |\\n| Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ   | instruction | 0.32  |  +0.5   |\\n| Mistral-7B         | instruction | 0.35  |  -0.5   |\\n| LLaMA-8B           | instruction | 0.30  |  +1.0   |\\n| QwQ-32B            | reasoning   | 0.04  |   0.0   |\\n| DeepSeek-R1-8B     | reasoning   | 0.05  |   0.0   |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0作为continuous predictor失败，仅作为binary indicator区分reasoning/instruction。 对analysis paper：C0的价值从\\\"predict gain\\\"转为\\\"characterize model behavior\\\"—— 一个关于模型内部一致性的诊断工具，而非SICA部署决策工具。\\n\\n\\n在worst tier下，C0与gap的连续相关性很弱（r=0.31, p=0.33），因为高C0的数据点 （7B/14B/Mistral/LLaMA instruction models）虽然都有C0>20%，但gap分布在 [-1pp, +2pp]之间，无清晰趋势。二值分类（C0>20% → potential gain vs C0<20% → no gain）准确率75%，但这主要是因为low-C0点（QwQ, DeepSeek-R1）gap全为0， 而不是因为high-C0点gap都>0。实质上C0只能区分\\\"reasoning vs instruction\\\"， 不能在instruction model内部预测gain大小。这使得Claim 3从\\\"continuous predictor\\\" 弱化为\\\"binary family classifier\\\"——而这基本等于直接看模型是否是reasoning model， C0作为diagnostic的增量价值存疑。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.783,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.783,\n      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.5,\n      \"c0\": 0.32,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.27,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.35,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.833,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.75,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.022,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 3.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"scaling_72b_row\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\\n|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\\n| 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\\n| 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\\n| 72B   | 78.3%  |  78.3%   | 0.0 | 0.50 | 0.32 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B数据点完善了within-family scaling故事。对analysis paper：展示了一个 \\\"sweet spot\\\"幻觉——14B似乎是optimal，但扩展到大样本后14B的gap也消失。 真正的故事是constraint extraction quality不随model size scaling。\\n\\n\\n72B模型更强→SC accuracy更高（78.3% vs 14B的70%），C0降到0.32（更confident→ 更少diversity）。Gap=0pp因为：(1) 高accuracy意味着SC已经选对了大部分题， 剩余错题是72B根本做不对的hard题；(2) C0=0.32虽然>20%但tiebreak题更少（约3个）， 样本太小无法产生可见gap；(3) 72B的constraint extraction质量虽然比7B/14B好， 但在它做错的题上constraints同样misleading。这个数据点支持\\\"stronger model → less room for SICA\\\"的叙事，但也支持worst tier的核心论点：即使在C0>20%的 optimal operating range内，SICA也不能reliably beat SC。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions' extracted constraints\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_analyzed\": 8,\n      \"semantically_meaningful_rate\": 0.45,\n      \"shallow_pattern_rate\": 0.35,\n      \"noise_rate\": 0.2,\n      \"correct_exclusion_rate\": 0.3,\n      \"false_exclusion_rate\": 0.15,\n      \"missed_error_rate\": 0.55,\n      \"finding\": \"Constraints are predominantly surface-level pattern matches, not deep logical validators\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是analysis paper最有叙事价值的实验之一。定性证据直接支撑\\\"why doesn't it work\\\" 的故事：extraction bottleneck。LLM-based constraint extraction无法从free-form reasoning traces中提取足够faithful的逻辑约束。\\n\\n\\n定性分析揭示constraint extraction的根本问题：(1) ~45%的constraints语义上有意义 但过于浅层（如\\\"answer must be True or False\\\"）,不能区分正确/错误推理； (2) ~35%是shallow pattern matches（从推理trace中提取的句法模式而非逻辑约束）； (3) ~20%是纯噪声（extraction hallucination或parse error）。关键发现：在SICA 选错而SC选对的题上，constraints质量与选对的题无显著差异——说明MaxSAT不是在 \\\"选择better constrained answer\\\"，而是在\\\"基于noisy signal做coin flip\\\"。 正确排除（exclusion导致正确答案翻转）仅30%，意味着大部分exclusion是neutral或harmful。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"avg_total_time_per_question_s\": 45.2,\n      \"avg_generation_time_s\": 38.5,\n      \"avg_extraction_time_s\": 5.8,\n      \"avg_maxsat_time_s\": 0.9,\n      \"generation_fraction\": 0.852,\n      \"extraction_fraction\": 0.128,\n      \"maxsat_fraction\": 0.02,\n      \"overhead_vs_sc_percent\": 17.4,\n      \"finding\": \"SICA adds ~17% wall-time overhead over SC, dominated by extraction LLM calls\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T4_overhead\",\n        \"content\": \"| Phase       | Time(s) | Fraction | Notes                    |\\n|-------------|---------|----------|--------------------------|\\n| Generation  |  38.5   |  85.2%   | Same as SC               |\\n| Extraction  |   5.8   |  12.8%   | 1 LLM call per trace     |\\n| MaxSAT      |   0.9   |   2.0%   | Z3, <100 constraints     |\\n| **Total**   |  45.2   | 100.0%   | +17.4% vs SC baseline    |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Overhead moderate但gain为零——cost-benefit明确为负。对analysis paper有价值： 排除\\\"overhead是barrier\\\"假说，聚焦在extraction quality而非computational cost。\\n\\n\\nGeneration（vLLM inference）占~85%时间，这与SC相同。SICA的额外overhead来自 constraint extraction（~13%，每个trace一次extraction LLM call）和MaxSAT solving （~2%，Z3在小规模constraint sets上极快）。总overhead ~17%在worst tier下意味着 \\\"付出17%时间代价换来0pp gain\\\"——对analysis paper来说这是一个重要的负面数据点。 但也说明overhead不是failure的原因（不是\\\"太贵所以不值\\\"而是\\\"even with acceptable cost it doesn't help\\\"）。Extraction时间可优化（batch inference）但不改变 fundamental result。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_mistral_7b\",\n    \"description\": \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, cross-family validation\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.55,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n      \"gap_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.65,\n      \"c0\": 0.35,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.3,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.38,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.633,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.523,\n      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.523,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.052,\n      \"constraint_parse_error_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 1.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"mistral_row\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model       | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap   | p    | C0   |\\n|-------------|--------|----------|-------|------|------|\\n| Mistral-7B  | 56.7%  |  55.0%   | -1.7  | 0.65 | 0.35 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Worst tier关键证据：high C0 + negative gap。C0 pattern跨家族成立（instruction models都有high C0），但这不translate to SICA gains。Extraction quality是 family-specific的，没有universal effectiveness。对analysis paper：constraint extraction的family-specificity是一个重要failure mode。\\n\\n\\nMistral-7B是一个关键的cross-family数据点。C0=0.35（>20%，instruction model 特征确认跨家族成立），但gap为负（-1.7pp）。原因：Mistral的reasoning trace风格与 Qwen不同——更短、更conversational、逻辑结构更隐式。基于Qwen trace风格tuned的 constraint extraction prompt在Mistral traces上效果更差（parse error rate 12% vs Qwen的~3%），产生更多noisy constraints。MaxSAT在noisy constraints下做出 worse-than-random的selection（exclusion rate 5.2%但exclusion更多是false positive）。 FOLIO上SICA反而比SC低3.3pp：3道FOLIO题上SICA的constraint-based选择选错了。 这是worst tier的smoking gun：SICA不仅不帮忙，在extraction quality差的情况下 actively harmful。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, third model family\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.533,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.517,\n      \"gap_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"bootstrap_p\": 0.4,\n      \"c0\": 0.3,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.27,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.32,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.567,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.485,\n      \"sica_accuracy_folio\": 0.6,\n      \"sica_accuracy_pw\": 0.485,\n      \"maxsat_exclusion_rate\": 0.038,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 1.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"llama_row\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model      | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap  | p    | C0   |\\n|------------|--------|----------|------|------|------|\\n| LLaMA-8B   | 51.7%  |  53.3%   | +1.7 | 0.40 | 0.30 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三家族validation完成：C0 pattern holds (all instruction models C0>20%)， 但SICA gain inconsistent across families (Qwen略正, Mistral负, LLaMA略正)。 对analysis paper：C0 as diversity indicator validated; SICA as accuracy method invalidated。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B的SC accuracy最低（51.7%），C0=0.30（instruction model，high diversity confirmed）。Gap=+1.7pp（p=0.40），方向正确但不显著。LLaMA的reasoning traces比 Mistral更structured（更接近Qwen风格），extraction quality中等，所以gap没有变负。 但在这么低的accuracy base上+1.7pp可能只是noise（1题的差异）。C0=0.30低于7B Qwen 的0.55，可能因为LLaMA-8B在PW/FOLIO上部分题直接输出random答案而非structured reasoning，这些\\\"collapsed\\\"traces有相同的non-answer，被误计为low diversity。 三家族一起看：Qwen +1.7, Mistral -1.7, LLaMA +1.7，平均gap≈+0.6pp——实质为零。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, cross-domain C0 test\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.9,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.9,\n      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0\": 0.1,\n      \"n_multi_candidate\": 3,\n      \"sc_baseline_high\": true,\n      \"constraint_extraction_issues\": \"Numeric answer space makes constraint extraction trivial but useless\",\n      \"wall_time_h\": 0.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"gsm8k_row\",\n        \"content\": \"| Dataset | Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   |\\n|---------|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|\\n| GSM8K   | 14B   | 90.0%  |  90.0%   | 0.0 | 0.10 |\\n| FOLIO   | 14B   | 74.0%  |  75.5%   | 1.5 | 0.38 |\\n| PW-D5   | 14B   | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |-0.1 | 0.42 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0 as task-relative confidence indicator validated。14B在easy tasks上low C0， hard tasks上high C0。但这不help SICA's accuracy case。对analysis paper： 丰富了C0的characterization story。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K对14B来说太简单（SC=90%），C0=10%远低于FOLIO/PW的38-42%。14B在GSM8K上 高度self-consistent因为这些是grade school math——模型confident且通常正确。 C0=10%中的3道multi-candidate题是calculation errors（不同traces算出不同数字）， constraint extraction对numeric answers基本无意义（constraints变成\\\"answer=72\\\" vs \\\"answer=84\\\"这种trivial形式，MaxSAT退化为counting）。Gap=0pp。 这个结果对analysis paper有双面价值：(1) 证明C0反映task-relative model confidence （14B在easy math上confident→low C0, 在logic reasoning上uncertain→high C0）； (2) 证明SICA在open-answer domain无additional failure mode，只是没value。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight, CPU ablation\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_problems\": 804,\n      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.723,\n      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.722,\n      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.718,\n      \"maxsat_vs_countonly_gap_pp\": 0.1,\n      \"maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp\": 0.5,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.72,\n      \"bootstrap_p_maxsat_vs_countonly\": 0.48,\n      \"tiebreak_agreement_maxsat_countonly\": 0.89,\n      \"finding\": \"MaxSAT satisfiability checking adds no value over simple constraint counting\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n        \"content\": \"| Method        | Accuracy | vs SC  | vs MaxSAT | p vs MaxSAT |\\n|---------------|----------|--------|-----------|-------------|\\n| SICA-MaxSAT   | 72.3%    | +0.3pp |    —      |      —      |\\n| SICA-CountOnly| 72.2%    | +0.2pp |  -0.1pp   |    0.48     |\\n| SICA-RandWt   | 71.8%    | -0.2pp |  -0.5pp   |    0.35     |\\n| SC baseline   | 72.0%    |   —    |  -0.3pp   |    0.42     |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MaxSAT is over-engineering confirmed。但在analysis paper中这是一个有价值的 negative finding：formal satisfiability checking对LLM-extracted constraints 无附加价值，因为constraints缺乏inter-dependencies。Reframe为\\\"when does formal reasoning over constraints add value? When constraints have structure.\\\"\\n\\n\\n这是Claim 1的make-or-break实验。在worst tier下MaxSAT≈count-only（gap仅0.1pp, p=0.48）。原因：MaxSAT的附加价值来自satisfiability checking——检测constraints 之间的逻辑一致性，排除internally contradictory constraint sets。但实际extracted constraints几乎都是独立的（无cross-constraint logical dependencies），因为 extraction prompt从each trace independently提取，不产生inter-constraint implications。结果Z3的satisfiability solver对所有constraint sets都返回SAT （没有unsatisfiable subsets to detect），MaxSAT退化为weighted counting。 Tiebreak上MaxSAT和count-only的选择89%一致。Random-weight略差但差距也很小 （0.5pp），说明constraint count本身与正确性的相关性非常微弱。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on 60 questions, second reasoning model\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.633,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.633,\n      \"gap_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"c0\": 0.05,\n      \"c0_folio\": 0.03,\n      \"c0_pw\": 0.06,\n      \"sc_accuracy_folio\": 0.7,\n      \"sc_accuracy_pw\": 0.59,\n      \"temperature_invariance\": true,\n      \"wall_time_h\": 1.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"reasoning_models_combined\",\n        \"content\": \"| Model              | Base   | Type      | C0   | Gap  |\\n|--------------------|--------|-----------|------|------|\\n| QwQ-32B            | Qwen   | reasoning | 3.6% | 0.0  |\\n| DeepSeek-R1-8B     | LLaMA  | reasoning | 5.0% | 0.0  |\\n| LLaMA-3.1-8B-Inst | LLaMA  | instruct  | 30%  | +1.7 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"对analysis paper的核心贡献之一：reasoning training fundamentally changes output diversity characteristics。Same LLaMA-8B base, instruction版C0=30%, reasoning版C0=5%。这是关于reasoning model internals的novel finding： reasoning training doesn't just improve accuracy, it collapses the output distribution. Frame为understanding WHY reasoning models are self-consistent.\\n\\nDeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B是第二个reasoning model数据点。C0=5%（与QwQ-32B的 3.6%相近），SICA≡SC。虽然这是8B的distilled版本（base是LLaMA而非Qwen），其 reasoning training使其表现出与QwQ-32B相同的self-consistency特征：extended thinking chain deterministically converges to single answer regardless of temperature sampling。C0=5%中的微量diversity来自PW（6%），可能是因为distillation 在logic domain上不如QwQ-32B彻底，少数题的reasoning chain有细微分歧。 关键确认：self-consistency是reasoning training的产物而非architecture/family 的产物（LLaMA base instruction model C0=30%, 同LLaMA base reasoning model C0=5%）。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":368,"startLine":1,"totalLines":368}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Wk3wCuRv2eBLun9guJ7YGX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of both the experimental data and the paper framing. Let me synthesize:\n\nThis is a **worst tier** dream paper, meaning all original accuracy claims failed. The narrative guidance says:\n\n> D023 triggered. All 3 original accuracy claims abandoned. Paper pivots to \"Why Doesn't Symbolic Consensus Improve LLM Reasoning? A Diagnostic Study.\" Contributions restructured: (1) C0 as zero-cost diversity indicator across model families; (2) Negative result on constraint-based aggregation; (3) Taxonomy of reasoning vs instruction model behavior under sampling. \n\nLooking at the experimental results across different model scales and configurations, the core pattern is clear: SICA's improvements consistently fail to reach significance. The 14B model shows only marginal gains that disappear with statistical testing, the tiebreak advantage erodes at scale, and even the 7B variant's high diversity doesn't translate to meaningful performance gains. This negative result is actually the paper's strength—it provides a diagnostic framework for understanding why symbolic consensus methods underperform in practice. Looking at the remaining experimental results—constraint ablation showing MaxSAT performs no better than simple counting, and the reasoning model variants all yielding negligible or non-significant improvements—I'm now pivoting the entire framing toward a diagnostic study that explains why symbolic consensus fails. I'm structuring this as a LaTeX paper with contributions around C0 as a zero-cost diversity metric, the failure modes of constraint-based aggregation, and how reasoning versus instruction-following models behave differently under sampling.\n\nWriting the paper structure now... I'm mapping out where each of the 14 experiments fits into the paper structure—the main results table will showcase the expanded 14B model, then I'll have dedicated sections for sensitivity analysis, tiebreak behavior, scaling across different model sizes and families, reasoning model performance, diagnostic validation, constraint quality, overhead metrics, and a cross-domain pilot on GSM8K, with the constraint ablation study filling out the remaining analysis. → Constraint Ablation (Table 9)\n14. sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b → Reasoning Models (combined in Table 6)\n\nI'll consolidate some tables. Let me write the paper.\n\nKey tables:\n- Table 1: Main results on expanded dataset (sica_expanded_14b)\n- Table 2: Tiebreak comparison (tiebreak_baseline_analysis)\n- Table 3: K sensitivity (sica_k_ablation_14b)\n- Table 4: Cross-model comparison (7B, 14B, 72B, Mistral, LLaMA, QwQ, DeepSeek-R1, GSM8K)\n- Table 5: Constraint ablation (constraint_ablation)\n- Table 6: Overhead breakdown (overhead_analysis)\n- Table 7: C0 diagnostic validation\n- Table 8: Constraint quality from case studies\n\nNow I'm ready to write out the complete LaTeX for the paper.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2318,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11569,"cache_read_input_tokens":23029,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11569},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02c0753b-3714-4e7c-8945-6ff304731670","uuid":"1915b1b3-fe25-4515-8a5c-302e185d0e82"}
